  m_text: "# GAME CREDITS\n\n## Development Team\n\n**Nguyen Tuan Minh**  \n*Game
    Developer \xB7 Game Designer*  \nUI/UX Design \xB7 Cutscenes \xB7 Animation \xB7
    Sound Effects \xB7 Visual Effects (VFX)\n\n**Tran Tuan Kiet**  \n*Game Developer
    \xB7 Game Designer*  \nPlayer Movement Mechanics \xB7 Enemy Movement \xB7 Score
    System \xB7 Push Mechanics\n\n## Art & Design Team\n\n**Le Phuong Linh**  \n*Game
    Artist \xB7 3D Modeller \xB7 Game Designer*  \nMap Modelling \xB7 Prop Modelling\n\n**Chau
    Bao Quyen**  \n*Game Artist \xB7 3D Modeller \xB7 Game Designer*  \nMap Modelling
    \xB7 Prop Modelling\n\n---\n\n**THANK YOU FOR PLAYING!**  \n*Made with passion
    by our team.*"
